Package: STCOS
Title: Spatial Transcriptomics Cell-type Oriented Simulator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yiyan", "Zhang", , "yiyan@unc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A simulator for spatial transcriptomics data with configurable
    spatial patterns, cell-type-specific expression profiles, and explicit
    latent Gaussian pairwise-dependence parameters. Realized count-scale
    dependence is generated through negative-binomial marginals and is not
    assumed to equal the latent target.
